e_test.ts` etc.\n\nThe 121+254 tests passed, but per the brief: \"A regression here would be invisible to unit tests that check only one of the two.\" So I should run an explicit composition check by execution: take REAL generated register-infrastructure.mts and register-apps.mts output (from the actual generators), apply BOTH injections, and verify:\n(a) emitted register-apps.mts type-checks (deno check on the injected module),\n(b) register-infrastructure.mts carries exactly one test-only registration per Auto arm,\n(c) fixture identifiers are collision-free.\n\nLet me first look at the composition test to see what it already proves, then decide what additional execution proof I need. Let me read the test file and the generate-register-infrastructure.ts.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"Parasail","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c1ca789b-c4ca-4f53-b9ac-092eb2e122d5","uuid":"32aa9fb2-c399-4179-9ae4-26820dbe49c6","timestamp":"2026-09-01T21:21:30.470Z","request_id":"gen-1788297646-iI2KX3QZuBGqmAe6WmS7"}
